{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31349","headline":"责汉水辞 · 李善夷","name":"责汉水辞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉之广兮，风波四起。\n虽有风波，不如蹄涔之水。\n蹄涔之水，不爲下国而倾天子。\n汉之深兮，其堤莫量。\n虽云莫量，不如行潦之汪。\n行潦之汪，不爲下国而溺天王。\n汉之美者曰鲂，吾虽饥不食其鲂，恐污吾之饥肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李善夷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31349.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31349","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}